    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Designed to help reduce visible buildup during daily brushing<\/p><p>✔ Full-mouth 360° sonic cleaning in just 30 seconds<\/p><p>✔ Ultra-soft silicone mouthpiece, gentle on teeth<\/p><p>✔ Hands-free brushing with even quadrant coverage<\/p><p>✔ 3 Smart Modes: Deep Clean, Gentle Clean, Gum Massage<\/p><p>✔ Built-in memory remembers your preferred setting<\/p><p>✔ IPX7 water-resistant, safe to rinse or use in the shower<\/p><p>✔ Fast charging and long-lasting battery (1+ week per charge)<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to keep it clean?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Remove the silicone mouthpiece from the base.<br\/><\/li><li>Rinse under warm water after each use.<br\/><\/li><li>Once a week, use a soft brush with mild soap to gently clean the surface.<br\/><\/li><li>Pat dry with a clean towel and allow to air dry completely.<br\/><\/li><li>Avoid alcohol, boiling water, or dishwashers.<\/li><\/ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ 1× 360° Sonic Electric U-Toothbrush<\/p><p>✔ 1× Charging Dock<\/p><p>✔ 1× USB Charging Cable<\/p><p>✔ 1x User Manual<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>Do not bite down hard, a light grip is enough.<br\/><br\/>Not suitable for children under 12.<br\/><br\/>Discontinue use if irritation occurs.<br\/><br\/>Only use the included charger and accessories.<\/p><p>Store in a cool, dry place between uses.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": " 360° Electric U-Toothbrush vs Manual Toothbrush",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Traditional brushing often feels rushed, with uneven pressure, missed spots, and poor timing that’s hard to keep consistent. The 360° U-Toothbrush takes the effort out of it, offering full-mouth coverage, built-in timing, and a soft silicone design that delivers a gentle, consistent clean — every time, without the guesswork.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yif9R8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it on veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The 360° U-Toothbrush uses ultra-soft silicone designed to be gentle. While it's suitable for most users, we recommend checking with your dentist before use if you have veneers, bonding, or fillings, just to be sure it's right for your dental setup.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
